{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決算の時期ですね。\nファイルの整理をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいファイルを使うにあたって\n2015年10月〜のテプラを\n大量に作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テプラ楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL生活もまずまずです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18日は個別握手会でした〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンが近い！\nということもあり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたるところで\nメンバーのコスプレを\n見ることが出来たのでは\nないでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私も例に余すことなく\nミニスカポリスに挑戦しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直やっぱり恥ずかしかったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかんせん\nみなさん煽てるのが上手くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の方にはまた着ちゃおっかな...？\nなんて思っちゃうほどでした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんありがとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま真夏さんも\n同じコスプレだったので\n一緒に(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに１・２部は普通に私服です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は付けたかったバレッタが\nあったのに忘れてしまって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話の内容は\n舞台の感想が1番多かったかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんたくさん\nありがとうございました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は11月ですね！\n会える方、よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーマンインサイト連載"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーマンインサイトさんで\n連載がスタートしました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんと一緒です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルとして、\nOLとして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろインタビューしていただいたので\n是非ご覧くださいm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.womaninsight.jp/archives/171137"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL的時間短縮術"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"節約方法"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/10/21/3652721/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒しグッズなどなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子に役立ちそうなことを\n記事にして頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te